Z||000000||Songman||06-28-2001||09:55 PM||||We're having a little informal get-together/swap meet/meeting/whatever this weekend for the Tennessee Fiero Users.<P>Of course, everyone withing driving distance is invited! The more the merrier! We're having it at Allan's house and he has a huge yard that we want to fill with Fieros!<P>The time is 1:00pm Saturday afternoon. All the directions are listed in the club section.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||06-28-2001||10:06 PM||||Oh man, and I was going to be out there but had to change my schedule. Oh well....<P>Where would it be? Alan's house? Is that like something well know to the local authorities?||||reg||1
Z||000002||spideyfoot||06-29-2001||09:32 AM||||Hey Ive got chips and pickle relish. See Im such the provider. Nothing fancy just my house. Hell thats all you need Fieros Food and Fun.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Songman||06-29-2001||11:25 AM||||Terry, Allan's house may very well be known to the local authorities! After all, he is one of those long-haired musician types. Probably playing loud music all hours of the night. Not to mention that he likes those Feearo cars!<P>Allan, We'll come up with some kinda food deal for Saturday. If not, we can all convoy down to the local Sonic and take over!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 06-29-2001).]||||reg||10
